<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eckerd Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eckerd Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Jonathan Ziegler said he cut his rating on Eckerd Corp to hold from buy on news that J.C. Penney Co Inc would acquire the company in a deal valued at about $3.3 million.</p>
<p>-- &quot;As a result of J.C. Penney's acquisition of Eckerd Corp ... the upside in Eckerd shares is now limited to a small risk arbitrage-like gain in the first quarter. Eckerd shares have appreciated 38.2 percent since our August 29 initiation of coverage report,&quot; Ziegler said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 33-5/8.</p>
</text>
